<title>USA: Premier Parks Inc Q3 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Premier Parks Inc Q3 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.39		    $0.95</p>
<p> Net			 16,238		    5,828</p>
<p> Revs			60,409		   29,403</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.11		    $0.79</p>
<p> Net			 10,512		    3,816</p>
<p> Revs			89,792		   38,771</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Company said increase in income in the first nine months of 1996 vs 1995 reflects its acquisition of three parks on August 15, 1995, as well as improved performance.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
